### =====================================================================
### ESGImpact API — MongoDB | roteiro completo de chamadas
### Ajuste @host conforme a execução (Docker: 8080 | dotnet run: 5xxx)
### =====================================================================
@host = http://localhost:8080
@contentType = application/json

### 0) Saúde da conexão com o MongoDB
GET {{host}}/api/health

### 0.1) Contagem de documentos das 5 collections
GET {{host}}/api/collections/stats

### 1) LOGIN — devolve o JWT (participante com credentials embutidas)
# @name login
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "username": "analista",
  "password": "Esg@2026"
}

### guarda o token da resposta anterior
@token = {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

### =====================================================================
### CRUD — collection 1: emission_factors  (E)
### =====================================================================

### CREATE
POST {{host}}/api/emission-factors
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "code": "TREM_REGIONAL",
  "activity": "Trem regional",
  "factorKgCo2PerUnit": 0.041,
  "unit": "km",
  "fieldLabel": "Quilômetros percorridos",
  "category": "transporte",
  "pillar": "E",
  "isActive": true,
  "source": { "agency": "ANTT", "year": 2026, "methodology": "tank-to-wheel" }
}

### READ — lista filtrada (filtro é um JSON do próprio MongoDB)
GET {{host}}/api/emission-factors?page=1&pageSize=5&sort=factorKgCo2PerUnit&desc=true&filter={"category":"transporte","isActive":true}

### READ — por código de negócio
GET {{host}}/api/emission-factors/CARRO

### UPDATE parcial ($set) — campos não enviados são preservados
PATCH {{host}}/api/emission-factors/TREM_REGIONAL
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "factorKgCo2PerUnit": 0.038,
  "review": { "status": "revisado", "reviewer": "ANL-001" }
}

### DELETE
DELETE {{host}}/api/emission-factors/TREM_REGIONAL

### =====================================================================
### CRUD — collection 2: simulations  (E)
### =====================================================================

### CREATE via serviço de domínio (calcula, classifica e persiste)
POST {{host}}/api/simulations
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "activity": "CARRO",
  "value": 85,
  "ownerCode": "CID-003",
  "source": "api"
}

### READ — histórico paginado
GET {{host}}/api/simulations?page=1&pageSize=5&ownerCode=CID-003

### READ — documento cru, com todos os campos flexíveis
GET {{host}}/api/simulation-documents?page=1&pageSize=3&sort=createdAt&desc=true&filter={"source":"iot"}

### UPDATE parcial
PATCH {{host}}/api/simulation-documents/000000000000000000000000
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "tags": ["revisado-manualmente"]
}

### =====================================================================
### CRUD — collection 3: participants  (S)
### =====================================================================

### CREATE — cidadão
POST {{host}}/api/participants
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "code": "CID-008",
  "type": "cidadao",
  "name": "Helena Duarte",
  "district": "Vila Mariana",
  "city": "São Paulo",
  "engagement": { "level": "bronze", "points": 0, "streakDays": 0 },
  "consent": { "lgpdAccepted": true, "shareAnonymizedData": true }
}

### CREATE em lote — organização com estrutura diferente na MESMA collection
POST {{host}}/api/participants/bulk
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

[
  {
    "code": "ORG-004",
    "type": "organizacao",
    "name": "Bike Express Entregas",
    "cnpj": "11.222.333/0001-44",
    "sector": "logistica",
    "employees": 54,
    "corporateGoals": [{ "metric": "tonCo2Ano", "target": 9, "baseline": 21 }]
  }
]

### READ — só organizações
GET {{host}}/api/participants?filter={"type":"organizacao"}

### UPDATE — gamificação
PATCH {{host}}/api/participants/CID-008
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "engagement": { "level": "prata", "points": 620, "streakDays": 7 }
}

### DELETE
DELETE {{host}}/api/participants/CID-008

### =====================================================================
### CRUD — collection 4: offset_projects  (E + S)
### =====================================================================

### CREATE
POST {{host}}/api/offset-projects
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "code": "PRJ-013",
  "name": "Hortas Urbanas em Terrenos Ociosos",
  "type": "agricultura_urbana",
  "status": "piloto",
  "capacityTonCo2Year": 42,
  "pricing": [{ "currency": "BRL", "pricePerTon": 135.0 }],
  "urbanFarming": { "plots": 18, "areaM2": 7400 },
  "socialImpact": { "familiesSupplied": 260, "jobsCreated": 14 },
  "sdgTargets": [2, 11, 13]
}

### READ — projetos ativos cotados em USD
GET {{host}}/api/offset-projects?filter={"status":"ativo","pricing.currency":"USD"}&sort=capacityTonCo2Year&desc=true

### UPDATE
PATCH {{host}}/api/offset-projects/PRJ-013
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "status": "ativo",
  "certifications": ["Gold Standard"]
}

### DELETE
DELETE {{host}}/api/offset-projects/PRJ-013

### =====================================================================
### CRUD — collection 5: governance_audits  (G)  — exige JWT
### =====================================================================

### CREATE
POST {{host}}/api/governance-audits
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "eventType": "policy_review",
  "occurredAt": { "$date": "2026-09-01T12:00:00Z" },
  "actor": { "participantCode": "ANL-001", "name": "Ana Lúcia Ferreira", "role": "Analyst" },
  "resource": { "collection": "participants", "documentCode": "ORG-002" },
  "checklist": [
    { "item": "Programa social documentado", "status": "ok" },
    { "item": "Meta com linha de base", "status": "pendente" }
  ],
  "compliance": { "framework": "GRI 305", "status": "parcial" }
}

### READ — trilha do fator CARRO
GET {{host}}/api/governance-audits?filter={"resource.documentCode":"CARRO"}&sort=occurredAt&desc=true
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### READ — eventos LGPD
GET {{host}}/api/governance-audits?filter={"compliance.framework":"LGPD"}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### =====================================================================
### Endpoints analíticos (Aggregation Framework)
### =====================================================================

### Dashboard ESG
GET {{host}}/api/analytics/dashboard?trendDays=30
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Recomendações com economia quantificada
GET {{host}}/api/recommendations

### Cotação de compensação nos projetos reais
POST {{host}}/api/offset/quote
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "currency": "BRL"
}
